  "text": "Coinbase documentation describes x402 Bazaar as a catalogue of payment-gated services discovered by the CDP Facilitator. Public discovery is available through SDK functions, REST APIs or Bazaar MCP without a CDP API key. Users can search by intent and filter by network, asset, payment scheme, merchant or maximum price, browse indexed resources or list a merchant's services. Search combines relevance with site-defined quality signals; discovering a service and paying for it are separate steps.",
